WEBVTT

NOTE Tailspin Trading – Discovery Workshop 3: IT landscape and integration
NOTE Thu 15 Oct 2026 14:00–15:30 GST, Teams. Attendees: Yusuf Ibrahim, Khalid Rahman (Tailspin); Omar Khalil, James Okafor (Frontier)
NOTE Fictitious test data – Copilot for Frontier Consultancy scenario testing

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
<v Omar Khalil>Yusuf, let's start with identity and hosting.</v>

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:23.000
<v Yusuf Ibrahim>Entra ID with MFA. Everything new must be single sign-on. Data must stay in the UAE, including backups.</v>

3
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
<v Omar Khalil>Integrations you need on day one?</v>

4
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:44.000
<v Yusuf Ibrahim>The rental app, the logistics partner's delivery status feed, the two banks, WhatsApp, and the data warehouse until we retire it.</v>

5
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.000
<v Omar Khalil>The rental app API, is it documented?</v>

6
00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:01.000
<v Yusuf Ibrahim>No. The developer left last year. It's .NET with SQL Server 2017 on-premises.</v>

7
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:08.000
<v James Okafor>Khalid, on finance: three entities, three countries?</v>

8
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:24.000
<v Khalid Rahman>UAE on SAP Business One, KSA and Oman on Sage 300. Month-end close takes eleven days because of intercompany and manual consolidation in Excel.</v>

9
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v James Okafor>Consolidation currency?</v>

10
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:46.000
<v Khalid Rahman>AED for the group, but the KSA bank wants SAR reporting. And ZATCA Phase 2 is live for us in KSA through a Sage add-on.</v>

11
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:56.000
<v James Okafor>Would you migrate ZATCA before the Sage cutover, or switch at go-live?</v>

12
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:08.000
<v Khalid Rahman>That's a question for you. The RFP is not clear. I'd prefer one switch at go-live.</v>

13
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.000
<v Omar Khalil>Historical data, how many years?</v>

14
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:27.000
<v Khalid Rahman>Open items and two years of balances for finance. Sales wants five years of history. That's not decided.</v>

15
00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:40.000
<v Yusuf Ibrahim>Remember we are two people in IT. Whatever you build, we need to support. Low code is preferred.</v>

16
00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:50.000
<v Omar Khalil>Understood. We'll favour Dataverse, Power Automate and Logic Apps over custom code.</v>
